{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34430","headline":"秋赋有期因寄袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"秋赋有期因寄袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云似无心水似闲，忽思名在贡书间。\n烟霞鹿弁聊悬着，隣里渔舠暂解还。\n文章病来犹满箧，药苗衰後即离山。\n广寒宫树枝多少，风送高低便可攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}